, y, finalmente, la imagen comienza a circular hasta que llega a Marge. Ella inicialmente expulsa a Homer de la casa, pero al día siguiente explica que ella no está molesta sobre Homer y el baile, sino que Bart lo haya visto. Le exige que hable con Bart y vayan a pedirle disculpas a la Princesa Kashmir. Homer acepta y dice que está listo para comenzar a respetar a las mujeres.","production_code":"7G10","runtime":24,"season_number":1,"show_id":456,"still_path":"/g3cCmeaIiCmSx7i5p0Mo0rWOqhH.jpg","vote_average":6.6,"vote_count":83,"crew":[{"department":"Writing","job":"Writer","credit_id":"5256bdc919c2956ff6001e1e","adult":false,"gender":2,"id":239,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Jon Vitti","original_name":"Jon Vitti","popularity":1.1882,"profile_path":"/rRk3EAiddu2veO3u8NwwV3U1oGR.jpg"},{"department":"Directing","job":"Director","credit_id":"5256c25b19c2956ff6006d81","adult":false,"gender":2,"id":165787,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Rich Moore","original_name":"Rich Moore","popularity":1.3615,"profile_path":"/oIAmkZf9LuJuMqR8zSchoD3FJT8.jpg"}],"guest_stars":[{"character":"Gulliver Dark (voice)","credit_id":"6110d383afa1b00030b2bef6","order":1228,"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":5176,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Sam McMurray","original_name":"Sam McMurray","popularity":2.1986,"profile_path":"/pbZSG0hprUcRkUF3q4NUUzvQX3E.jpg"},{"character":"Princess Kashmir / Fe-Mail-Man / Churchgoer (voice)","credit_id":"61683b8981c7be00927f5116","order":1293,"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":6007,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Maggie Roswell","original_name":"Maggie Roswell","popularity":1.2685,"profile_path":"/pLdSmH5HZYSwTd3aiPlZLbNzvPD.jpg"},{"character":"Milhouse Van Houten (voice)","credit_id":"66d03a008378b206bc8842b1","order":1625,"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":6009,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Pamela Hayden","original_name":"Pamela Hayden","popularity":1.5104,"profile_path":"/mPMtuVB6AEulRhlfn69y5RvgmNT.jpg"},{"character":"Martin Pr